  file.svg                         mods/portrait-files, mods/bar-strip                          -> files
  folder.svg                       mods/portrait-files                                          -> files, workspace-chrome
  changes.svg                      mods/bar-strip  (the Changes button)                         -> changes
  close.svg                        mods/portrait-tabs, mods/portrait-pane, mods/nvim-float,
